{
  "$comment": "Reglas de autorización ejecutables. Las firmas (JWT del borde, Access, E1) las verifica el verificador común R1 con los vectores de edge `test/vectors/req.json` (edge 0af0a5b); aquí se prueban las decisiones sobre claims YA verificados.",
  "event_producer": {
    "$comment": "authenticated = sujeto E1 verificado de QUIEN ENTREGA (E1 autentica cada salto). Entrega directa: el sujeto debe ser del productor. Entrega por relé: E1 solo prueba al relé; el productor se prueba únicamente con el JWS del evento (vectors/event-jws-v1.json, attested). Sin JWS, un relé nunca vale como billing. `irreversible` es informativo: el efecto irreversible además exige el handshake de destrucción (gate cerrado).",
    "cases": [
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:billing",
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": true,
        "result": "ok"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:billing",
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.credits.changed.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "ok"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:workspaces",
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "producer_subject_mismatch"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:identity",
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "identity",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "producer_type_mismatch"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:unknown",
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "unknown",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "producer_unknown"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:billing",
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.purchase.paid.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "type_unknown"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:events-relay",
        "delivery": "relay",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": true,
        "result": "producer_unattested"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": "svc:events-relay",
        "delivery": "relay",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "producer_unattested"
      },
      {
        "authenticated": null,
        "delivery": "direct",
        "type": "ai.danil.billing.entitlement.changed.v1",
        "producer": "billing",
        "irreversible": false,
        "result": "unauthenticated"
      }
    ]
  },
